GAS LISTING C:\Users\Administrator\AppData\Local\Temp\ccdV3Oec.s 			page 20


 615              	 * This function modify ECLIC Interrupt Input Control register of the specific interrupt \em IRQn.
 616              	 * \param [in]      IRQn  Interrupt number
